703
00:32:35,621 --> 00:32:37,389
Mmm.

704
00:32:39,025 --> 00:32:41,327
Dije, espero que se
marchiten y se caigan.

705
00:32:42,594 --> 00:32:44,363
Esperas lo que se marchita

706
00:32:44,396 --> 00:32:45,497
